<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Practical 6</title>
<style>
        .container {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr 200px; 
  grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto;      
  grid-template-areas: 
    "header header header"
    "nav    main   aside"
    "footer footer footer";
  min-height: 100vh;
}

header { grid-area: header; background: #34495e; color: white; }
nav    { grid-area: nav;    background: #ecf0f1; }
main   { grid-area: main;   background: #fff;    }
aside  { grid-area: aside;  background: #ecf0f1; }
footer { grid-area: footer; background: #2c3e50; color: white; }

header, nav, main, aside, footer {
  padding: 20px;
  text-align: center;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Practical 6</h1>
    <h1>This page shows the creation of grail layout using CSS.</h1>
    <div class="container">
      <header>Header <br><br> (This is where the header gets displayed.)</header>
      <nav>Navigation <br><br><br><br><br>(This area displays the left side bar which is also known as navigation bar.)</nav>
      <main>Main Content <br><br><br><br><br>(This space is used to display the main content of the screen.)</main>
      <aside>Sidebar <br><br><br><br><br> (This area displays the right side bar and its content.)</aside>
      <footer>Footer <br><br> (This is where the footer gets displayed.)</footer>
    </div>
    
</body>
</html>
